# Views

## Conventions

- Tailwind CSS for all styling
- Turbo Frames for partial page updates
- Turbo Streams for real-time broadcasts
- Partials for reusable view components (prefix with `_`)
- Use `form_with` (never `form_for` or `form_tag`) - Turbo-compatible by default
- Never use `local: true` on forms (disables Turbo)

## Layouts

- `application.html.erb` - Main layout with flash messages and navigation

